Attribution:
  PaperSizes.guide paper size dataset — https://papersizes.guide/data/ — CC BY 4.0

The dimensions themselves are published facts drawn from ISO 216, ISO 217,
ISO 269, ANSI/ASME Y14.1, JIS P 0138, GB/T 148 and the trade standards named on
each size page. Facts are not copyrightable; this licence covers the
compilation, the naming and the cross-references.
